    ke:committee "ISO/TC 37/SC 1" ; ke:contentType "Guidance (methods)" ;
    dcterms:description "How objects, concepts, definitions and designations relate; principles for forming terms and writing intensional definitions."@en ;
    ke:relevance "Governs how definitions are written, e.g. 'A client employer is an employer that directs day-to-day work and contracts with a PEO…'."@en ;
    ke:isoPage <https://www.iso.org/standard/79077.html> .
ke:ISO1087 a skos:Concept , ke:Standard ; skos:inScheme ke:Scheme ; skos:broader ke:Grp_Terminology ;
