    ke:relevance "Defines the fields of the PEO term base (term, definition, source, usage status, jurisdiction note)."@en ;
    ke:isoPage <https://www.iso.org/standard/79078.html> .
ke:ISO30042 a skos:Concept , ke:Standard ; skos:inScheme ke:Scheme ; skos:broader ke:Grp_Terminology ;
